      "caption": "Figure 6.9 The process of creativity is not random; it is a specific and logical process that includes evaluation. The entrepreneur repeats the creative process until reaching a successful solution. (attribution: Copyright Rice University, OpenStax, under CC BY NC-SA 4.0 license)"
